Summarize today's domain monitoring report.

Date: {{ $json.scanDate }}
Total domains monitored: {{ $json.totalMonitored }}
Domains with alerts: {{ $json.domains.length }}

Critical / expired ({{ $json.critical.length }}):
{{ $json.critical.map(d => `- ${d.domain}: ${d.daysUntilExpiry < 0 ? 'EXPIRED ' + Math.abs(d.daysUntilExpiry) + ' days ago' : d.daysUntilExpiry + ' days left'}${d.autoRenew ? ' (auto-renew ON)' : ' ⚠ MANUAL RENEWAL'}`).join('\n') || 'none' }}

Needing manual action (no auto-renew):
{{ $json.needsAction.map(d => `- ${d.domain}: ${d.daysUntilExpiry} days, registrar: ${d.registrar||'unknown'}`).join('\n') || 'none' }}

All alerts:
{{ $json.domains.map(d => `${d.domain}: ${d.daysUntilExpiry !== undefined ? d.daysUntilExpiry + 'd' : 'unknown expiry'} (${d.urgency})${d.autoRenew ? ' auto' : ''}`).join(', ') }}

What needs action today and why.

